{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sunset Racing\u00a0</strong>is the ultimate casual racing party game, designed to bring the fun with you wherever you go. A top down RC Racing game inspired by classic karting games.\u00a0 With just a Steam Deck, you can challenge a friend, or scale up for epic group races! Inspired by the nostalgia of coffee table arcade cabinets and the excitement of arcades, <strong>Sunset Racing\u00a0</strong>offers multiple control modes to suit any gathering:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Couch Party Mode</strong>: Classic top down RC racing for up to 4 players with 4 controllers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Coffee Table Mode</strong>: Play up to 8 players with only 4 controllers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mobile Device Mode</strong>: Connect to the game via a simple web page controller and play anywhere with WiFi for up to 8 players!*</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lots of tracks and Car Soccer!</strong><br> <br>*Web controller performance depends on network connection stability, the responsiveness may vary.\u00a0 </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3958680?t=1772848716","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958680/62e7014bd285078781479c881b4ca158e4f21aa8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772848716","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958680/9927f2e4dce1eb779a6d18f6c8d835bcb993b2a6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772848716","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958680/9927f2e4dce1eb779a6d18f6c8d835bcb993b2a6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772848716","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4147330,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sunset Racing\u00a0</strong>is the ultimate casual racing party game, designed to bring the fun with you wherever you go. A top down RC Racing game inspired by classic karting games.\u00a0 With just a Steam Deck, you can challenge a friend, or scale up for epic group races! Inspired by the nostalgia of coffee table arcade cabinets and the excitement of arcades, <strong>Sunset Racing\u00a0</strong>offers multiple control modes to suit any gathering:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Couch Party Mode</strong>: Classic top down RC racing for up to 4 players with 4 controllers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Coffee Table Mode</strong>: Play up to 8 players with only 4 controllers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mobile Device Mode</strong>: Connect to the game via a simple web page controller and play anywhere with WiFi for up to 8 players!*</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lots of tracks and Car Soccer!</strong><br> <br>*Web controller performance depends on network connection stability, the responsiveness may vary.\u00a0 </p>","developers":["Unprecedented Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958680/6e859b4a89e95a66fad7d06846efec33c8859a28/header.jpg?t=1772848716","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ste